    {
      "id": "c3a2cbbdf963",
      "name": "Quest Advancement (round-robin)",
      "prompt": "Advance active quests in round-robin fashion. The pre-run script (quest_advance.py) has already fetched quest data from N56VV and saved it to /tmp/quests_raw.txt, /tmp/quests_parsed.json, and updated ~/.hermes/quest-advancement-state.json. Read these files to see what happened.\n\nYour job now is to:\n1. Read /tmp/quests_raw.txt to see the quest files\n2. Read ~/.hermes/quest-advancement-state.json to see which quest was advanced\n3. If the advancement succeeded, verify by asking N56VV to read the updated quest file\n4. If not, handle the error\n5. Optionally send an email summary. Ask N56VV to send it via its himalaya (virgilio \u2192 gmail).",
